{"id":"d717e4bca71bf2bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-compact-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Effectively Compact Set","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-compact-set — ZFC Recursion4 Effectively Compact Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-compact-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-compact-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-compact-set — ZFC Recursion4 Effectively Compact Set","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-compact-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-compact-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-compact-set — ZFC Recursion4 Effectively Compact Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73b72c6204e34088\" href=\"?note=73b72c6204e34088\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,K,\\mathcal U\\in V\">\\(X,K,\\mathcal U\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(F_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\">\\((F_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\\)</span> is a fixed effective enumeration of the finite subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2CeSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2CeSet}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"73b72c6204e34088\" href=\"?note=73b72c6204e34088\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4EffectivelyCompactSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4EffectivelyCompactSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}effectively\\text{-}compact\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4EffectivelyCompactSet}_S(X,K,\\mathcal U)\\leftrightarrow\nK\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal U,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\in\\mathcal U(n))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nK\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in A}\\mathcal U(n)\\to\n\\exists F\\subseteq A\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land K\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in F}\\mathcal U(n))\\Bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2CeSet}_S\\!\\left(\n\\{e\\in\\omega:K\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in F_e}\\mathcal U(n)\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}effectively\\text{-}compact\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4EffectivelyCompactSet}_S(X,K,\\mathcal U)\\leftrightarrow\nK\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal U,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\in\\mathcal U(n))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nK\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in A}\\mathcal U(n)\\to\n\\exists F\\subseteq A\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land K\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in F}\\mathcal U(n))\\Bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2CeSet}_S\\!\\left(\n\\{e\\in\\omega:K\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in F_e}\\mathcal U(n)\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Relative to the effective basic-open enumeration <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>, compactness and c.e. recognizability of finite basic covers are both required.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"73b72c6204e34088","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion2-ce-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch1